  "label": "Racialized Medical Experimentation",
  "description": "The image and text imply a history of racialized medical experimentation on Black people, where their bodies were subjected to invasive procedures without consent. The restraint scene is a visual echo of such experiments, which were often justified by pseudoscientific claims about racial inferiority and the need for population control.",
